# Python Image Load By Non-Python Process | T1027.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_susp_python_image_load.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=7 Description="Python Core" NOT (Image="*Python*" OR Image IN ("C:\\Program Files\\*", "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\*", "C:\\ProgramData\\Anaconda3\\*")) NOT NOT Image=*
